{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":498473,"name":"Vikas Dakshi","username":"Vikas_Dakshi","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/v/e19adc/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-22T19:01:33.020Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-498473-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-498473-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-498473-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-498473-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe agent computer never becomes reachable. Banner reads “Can’t reach your computer.” Recover and Reset both fail server-side at the identical stage — “Starting Grok Bot’s computer,” then error out. Reset wipes data before failing, so retrying is destructive with no chance of success.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-498473-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-498473-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLaunch Grok Bot, Pro account. Banner: “Can’t reach your computer.”\u003cbr\u003e\nRun Recover → stalls at “Starting Grok Bot’s computer,” 50% → “Recovery couldn’t finish.”\u003cbr\u003e\nRun Reset → wipes data, creates computer, stalls at same step, 50% → “Reset couldn’t finish. Computer may be in a partial state.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-498473-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-498473-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRecover or Reset provisions a working agent computer the app can reach.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-498473-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-498473-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/2/b/2bc066a75dc10aa724c2f59d889d114ce3fb4d32.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/6f2Kp354s7N6866tT6CubN1fU0q.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-09-23 at 12.04.53 AM.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/b/2bc066a75dc10aa724c2f59d889d114ce3fb4d32_2_690x194.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-23 at 12.04.53 AM.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"6f2Kp354s7N6866tT6CubN1fU0q\" width=\"690\" height=\"194\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/b/2bc066a75dc10aa724c2f59d889d114ce3fb4d32_2_690x194.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/b/2bc066a75dc10aa724c2f59d889d114ce3fb4d32_2_1035x291.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/b/2bc066a75dc10aa724c2f59d889d114ce3fb4d32_2_1380x388.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1C1C1C\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eScreenshot 2026-09-23 at 12.04.53 AM.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e2010×568 73.4 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/d/4/d402a21236a0552ac43772abaa3d193d91cdb87d.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/ufwRDsPYt9lOiSjCeet3L5eLedn.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-09-23 at 12.24.22 AM.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\